   "verbJa": "する",
   "verbSense": "do; the general verb, and sports and games are things you 'do'",
   "englishVerb": "play",
   "trap": "Not sakkaa o asobu: asobu means playing around, so a sport takes suru, or casually yaru (sakkaa yatteru).",
